Package: TiDEomics
Title: Time-course Differential Expression analysis of omics data
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-04-29
Authors@R: 
    person("Tianen", "He", email = "tianen.he@ndm.ox.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
            comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6864-0723"))
Description: TiDEomics (Time-course Differential Expression of omics data) is designed to streamline analysis of time-course omics data. It allows integrated comparison of >2 groups, and is compatible with data with missing values (e.g. mass spectrometry-based proteomics data). Functions include data processing, statistical methods, and visualisation.
